     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\" dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"></p>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Hi, </span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">My name is Jaci and I&#39;m a student at ANU. <font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">I&#39;m\r\n currently analysing data using latent profile analysis and am using the tidyLPA package in conjunction with mclust to do so. I was hoping to get some help about conducting a 3-step LPA.</span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">  (1) I have\r\n 3 continuous variables from which I would like to predict latent profiles. I would additionally like to (2) </span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">use predictor variables to create latent class probabilities for the most likely latent\r\n class membership, as well as (3) using these latent profiles as a predictor of distal outcomes. </span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Unfortunately I haven&#39;t been\r\n able to find any syntax which enables me to conduct steps 2 and 3 in r and I was wondering whether this is possible with the mclust/tidy package?</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Many thanks in advance for any help. </span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><br>\r\n</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">\r\n<font face=\"Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,Apple Color Emoji,Segoe UI Emoji,NotoColorEmoji,Segoe UI Symbol,Android Emoji,EmojiSymbols\" size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Jaci Swinton</span></font></span></font></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
